<title>DENMARK: Oeresundsforbindelsen raises 4.0 pct bond issue.</title>
<headline>Oeresundsforbindelsen raises 4.0 pct bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmarks's A/S Oeresundsforbindelsen has increased a four percent, seven-year bond offer, announced last Thursday, to 600 million crowns from 300 million, lead manager Gudme Raaschou Bankaktieselskab said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>All the bonds had been sold, it added.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
